      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>By the religion <i>of the Jews</i>, on account of great hunger</li>\n<li>and fasting a veil has come across my eyes</li>\n<li>and a blot over my heart such that I do not know what</li>\n<li>I am writing. Forgive me and do not [...]</li>\n<li>me that I cut short your honorific titles, for you are abo[v]e</li>\n<li>all need for such description. May God not cut you off (from support).</li>\n<li>I trust in God and in you to give me sustenance</li>\n<li>and to act <i>kindly</i> and with charity. <i>And peace</i>.</li>\n<li>By the religion of God's unity, I have benefited only</li>\n<li>from a nightly loaf, half of which I eat at night</li>\n<li>[an]d half for lunch. May God never lead you to</li>\n<li>bad times,<i> amen sela</i>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n<li>If you have a Jewish celebration including ritual slaughter for distribution do not</li>\n<li>forget a piece of meat or something else</li>\n<li>as <i>charity</i> for me, because I am a foreigner</li>\n<li>and know nobody. Whatever you do</li>\n<li>for me, God will produce for you in return.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
